 D. Baldi, Friicat: A first catalog of fr ii radio galaxies, Astronomy \& Astrophysics 601 (2017) A81. [7] R. D. Baldi, A. Capetti, F. Massaro, Fr0cat: a first catalog of fr 0 radio galaxies, Astronomy \& Astrophysics 609 (2017) A1. [8] D. D. Proctor, Morphological annotations for groups in the first database, The Astrophysical Journal Supplement Series 194 (2011) 31.},
